s/method-map/v1-9709/codex-semantic-shards/semkg_9709_p0_codex_calibration_001.semantic-assertion-proposals.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/semantic-kg-codex-calibration-shard.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/semantic-kg-codex-calibration-shard.validator-result.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/semantic-kg-codex-calibration-shard.readback.md`\n\n## Machine-Readable Closeout Counts\n\n```json\n{\n  \"accepted_count\": 0,\n  \"provisional_safe_count\": 0,\n  \"accepted_eligibility_candidate_count\": 24,\n  \"provisional_safe_eligibility_candidate_count\": 100,\n  \"review_required_count\": 0,\n  \"rejected_count\": 0,\n  \"blocked_quarantined_count\": 0,\n  \"covered_question_count\": 25,\n  \"assertion_count\": 124,\n  \"visual_row_count\": 12,\n  \"text_only_row_count\": 12,\n  \"represented_predicates\": [\n    \"procedure_has_step\",\n    \"question_aligns_syllabus_objective\",\n    \"question_invokes_concept\",\n    \"question_requires_skill\",\n    \"question_uses_procedure\"\n  ],\n  \"topic_component_groups\": [\n    \"1:9709.p1.integration\",\n    \"1:9709.p1.series\",\n    \"1:9709.p1.trigonometry\",\n    \"1:9709.p3.vectors\",\n    \"2:9709.p2.differentiation\",\n    \"2:9709.p2.logarithmic_and_exponential_functions\",\n    \"2:9709.p2.trigonometry\",\n    \"3:9709.p3.differential_equations\",\n    \"3:9709.p3.logarithmic_and_exponential_functions\",\n    \"3:9709.p3.numerical_solution_of_equations\",\n    \"3:9709.p3.vectors\",\n    \"4:9709.p4.energy_work_and_power\",\n    \"4:9709.p4.forces_and_equilibrium\",\n    \"4:9709.p4.kinematics_of_motion_in_a_straight_line\",\n    \"5:9709.p4.forces_and_equilibrium\",\n    \"5:9709.p4.kinematics_of_motion_in_a_straight_line\",\n    \"6:9709.p5.permutations_and_combinations\",\n    \"6:9709.p5.probability\",\n    \"6:9709.p5.representation_of_data\",\n    \"6:9709.p5.the_normal_distribution\"\n  ],\n  \"external_model_call_count\": 0,\n  \"promotion_over_real_shards_performed\": false,\n  \"blockers_or_deferrals\": \"Accepted/provisional values are eligibility candidates only; #1367 promotion gate must perform any layer promotion. High-risk prerequisite/misconception/mastery predicates were excluded.\"\n}\n```\n\n## Validation\n\n- `node scripts/method-map/build-semantic-kg-codex-calibration-shard.mjs --write` -> pass; validator_status `pass`; 25 rows, 124 assertions, 24 accepted-eligibility candidates, 100 provisional-safe eligibility candidates, 0 direct promotions.\n- `node scripts/method-map/build-semantic-kg-codex-shard-preflight-gate.mjs --write` -> pass; existing fixture gate remains validator_status `pass`.\n- `node --experimental-vm-modules /home/samsen/code/ciecopilot-home/node_modules/jest/bin/jest.js --runInBand --runTestsByPath scripts/method-map/__tests__/semantic-kg-codex-calibration-shard.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/semantic-kg-codex-shard-preflight-gate.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/semantic-kg-codex-shard-contract.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/semantic-kg-codex-native-boundary.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/semantic-kg-status-provenance-promotion-model.test.js` -> 5 suites passed, 25 tests passed.\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` -> exit 0; top_status `warning` only for expected AO branch naming and dirty/generated files before commit; guard checks healthy.\n","created_at":"2026-07-06T08:42:21Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T08:57:36Z","closed_at":"2026-07-06T08:57:35Z","merged_at":"2026-07-06T08:57:35Z","merge_commit_sha":"96fbee32a252215e22acf8aca91bc9578e8fd445","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1386/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1386/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/rep